  "candidate": "theorem InitsUpdatesComm\n  {P : PureExpr} {\u03c3 \u03c3' \u03c3'' : SemanticStore P}\n  {ks ks' : List P.Ident} {vs vs' : List P.Expr} :\n  UpdateStates \u03c3 ks vs \u03c3' \u2192\n  InitStates \u03c3' ks' vs' \u03c3'' \u2192\n  \u2203 \u03c3\u2081,\n    \u03c3\u2081 = (updatedStates \u03c3 ks' vs') \u2227\n    InitStates \u03c3 ks' vs' \u03c3\u2081 \u2227\n    UpdateStates \u03c3\u2081 ks vs \u03c3'' := by\n  intros Hup Hinit\n  have hlu := UpdateStatesLength Hup\n  have hli := InitStatesLength Hinit\n  refine \u27e8_, rfl, updatedStatesInit hli\n    (UpdateStatesNotDefMonotone' (InitStatesNotDefined Hinit) Hup) (InitStatesNodup Hinit), ?_\u27e9\n  \u00b7 rw [InitStatesUpdated Hinit, UpdateStatesUpdated Hup]\n    unfold updatedStates\n    rw [updatedStatesComm (kvs := ks.zip vs) (kvs' := ks'.zip vs') (by\n      rw [List.unzip_zip hlu, List.unzip_zip hli]\n      intro k hk hk'\n      simpa [InitStatesNotDefined Hinit k hk'] using UpdateStatesDefined Hup k hk)]\n    apply updatedStatesUpdate hlu\n    exact updatedStatesDefMonotone <| UpdateStatesDefined' Hup"
